  "sourceTitle": "Chutnie",
  "sourceText": "Chutnie\nBy: Nitti Sachdeva\nPublished: Monday, November 30, 2009 - 11:24pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n5 cups fruit\n3 cups Water\n1 package Natural Pectin\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook fruit 2 Add the rest of the ingredients.\n\nAbout\n\n\nThe all natural chutney is sweet, sour, spicy with soft chunks of fruit with and without seeds.\nEnjoy on bread as jam, wrap in tortilla sandwiches, dip with pita chips.....\nTop on Grilled White Meats....\nEnjoy with friends and family.\n\nComments:\nNitti Sachdeva\n\nlove it !",
